        "description": "EllaPress is a fully responsive Retina enabled One Page &amp; Multipurpose WordPress Theme suitable for any kind of creative or business use. Premium Kenburn Slider Effects Free from EllaPress. The theme is highly optimized for both mobile and desktop platforms. One uses lazy-loading of images and compression of all required scripts, meaning not only will your website look great, but it will also be lightening fast. In case you would like to integrate an online shop to your website you will benefit from WooCommerce compatibility provided by this parallax WordPress Theme. EllaPress can be used for all kinds of business or corporate websites and is furthermore suitable for personal online presences. Thanks to its responsiveness, your content will be displayed well-organized on all kinds of screen size resolutions, EllaPress SEO Ready and translatabe with Polylang and WPML. EllaPress is SEO Ready. EllaPress supports popular WordPress plugins such as Elementor, WPML, Polylang, Yoast SEO, WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, Jetpack, and much more. The PRO demo at https://pixelonetry.com/previews/?theme=ella-premium"
